@@ -0,0 +1,90 @@
+## In `api-server.py`
+
+turn `POST /predict_duration` into `POST /predict_prosody_features`.
+
+### Request Format Change
+
+Old requests look like:
+
+```json
+{
+  "language": {
+    "iso639-3": "cmn",
+    "segmentationFormat": "fastspeech2-pinyin-r?tones"
+  },
+  "speed": 1,
+  "segments": [
+    { "text": "测", "phonemes": ["c", "e4"] },
+    { "text": "试", "phonemes": ["sh", "iii4"] }
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+New requests should look like:
+
+```jsonc
+{
+  "language": {
+    "iso639-3": "cmn",
+    "segmentationFormat": "fastspeech2-pinyin-r?tones"
+  },
+  "segments": [
+    { "text": "测", "phonemes": ["c", "e4"] },
+    { "text": "试", "phonemes": ["sh", "iii4"] }
+  ],
+  "duration": { "speed": 1 }, // or: `"duration": { "durationTicks2d": […], "ticksPerSecond": … }`
+  "pitch": { "pitch2d": [[42], [42, 42]] }, // or `"pitch": null`
+  "energy": { "energy2d": [[42], [42, 42]] } // or `"energy": null`
+}
+```
+
+### Response Format Change
+
+Old responses look like:
+
+```json
+[
+  "ok",
+  {
+    "durationTicks2d": [[42], [42, 42]],
+    "ticksPerSecond": 42
+  }
+]
+```
+
+New responses should look like:
+
+```json
+[
+  "ok",
+  {
+    "durationTicks2d": [[42], [42, 42]],
+    "ticksPerSecond": 42,
+    "pitch2d": [[42], [42, 42]],
+    "energy2d": [[42], [42, 42]]
+  }
+]
+```
+
+## In `refactoring/inference_service.py`
+
+`predict_duration` and `predict_pitch_and_energy` should be merged into a single
+method `predict_prosody_features`.
+
+signature:
+
+```py3
+def predict_prosody_features(
+    self,
+    lang: LanguageSpecifier,
+    phonemize_result: PhonemizeResult,
+    duration: DurationResult | DurationOptions | None, # DurationOptions: { speed: float }
+    pitch: PitchResult | PitchOptions | None, # PitchOptions: { pitch_control: float }
+    energy: EnergyResult | EnergyOptions | None, # EnergyOptions: { energy_control: float }
+    **opts: Any,
+) -> PredictResult: ...
+```
+
+## In `refactoring/adapters.py`
+
+merge `extract_duration_from_output` into `create_predict_result`.
